    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1: New Lead Intake\n\n**Trigger:** Webhook receives lead data from RentEngine\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Validate lead has phone or email\n2. Check for duplicates in data table\n3. Assign leasing rep (round-robin)\n4. Send welcome SMS to lead\n5. Create callback task (due in 15 min)\n6. Notify leasing team via Slack\n\n**Error Handling:**\n- Invalid leads are logged\n- Duplicates are ignored\n- SMS/task/notification failures alert admin",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 1800,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "e158ae49-1a47-44ce-962f-939fc6e8b7ce",
      "name": "Sticky Note 90a06e74",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        176,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 2: Lead Stops Responding\n\n**Trigger:** Schedule (every 4 hours)\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Fetch leads with status=Open and no update in 24h\n2. Mark leads as \"Stale - Follow Up Needed\"\n3. Send follow-up SMS to lead\n4. Notify leasing manager for review",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "d4eb747b-c6a9-49ad-9a9e-928b50aa94ac",
      "name": "Sticky Note d658b302",
